{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":46,"ref":"genesis 27:46","book":"genesis","lang":"de","chapter":27,"translation":"Und Riwka sprach zu Jizchak: „Mir ist es zuwider in meinem Leben wegen der Töchter Chets. Wenn Jaakow eine Frau nimmt von den Töchtern Chets, wie diese, von den Töchtern des Landes, wozu mir ⟨dann⟩ Leben?","tokens":[{"surface":"ותאמר","gloss":"Und ⟨sie⟩ sprach"},{"surface":"רבקה","gloss":"Riwka"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"zu"},{"surface":"יצחק","gloss":"Jizchak"},{"surface":"קצתי","gloss":"ist ⟨es⟩ mir zuwider"},{"surface":"בחיי","gloss":"in meinem Leben"},{"surface":"מפני","gloss":"wegen"},{"surface":"בנות","gloss":"der Töchter"},{"surface":"חת","gloss":"Chets"},{"surface":"אם","gloss":"Wenn"},{"surface":"לקח","gloss":"nimmt"},{"surface":"יעקב","gloss":"Jaakow"},{"surface":"אשה","gloss":"eine Frau"},{"surface":"מבנות","gloss":"von den Töchtern"},{"surface":"חת","gloss":"Chets"},{"surface":"כאלה","gloss":"wie diese"},{"surface":"מבנות","gloss":"von den Töchtern"},{"surface":"הארץ","gloss":"des Landes"},{"surface":"למה","gloss":"wozu"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"mir"},{"surface":"חיים","gloss":"Leben"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-05T17:35:36.823390643Z","model":"glm-5.2"}